 7. 🤘 Texas topples No. 1 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Texas Longhorns quarterback Arch Manning celebrates the game-tying touchdown late in the game against Ohio State in Austin last night. Photo: David Buono/Icon Sportswire via Getty Images Get ready for a new No. 1 team when AP's Top 25 college football poll is released this afternoon.

 No. 4 Texas staked its claim after wiping out a 20-point, fourth-quarter deficit to beat top-ranked Ohio State 24-23 last night in Austin. The comeback is the largest fourth-quarter rally ever for a win against an AP No. 1 team, according to Sportradar. Go deeper . 

 
 
